{"id":"t07-5ef2d5","status":"read","groups":[{"levels":[[{"surface":"عبد الله بن منير","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبا النضر","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"عبد الرحمن","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبيه","kind":"relation"}],[{"surface":"أبي صالح","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}],[{"surface":"أبي هريرة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"سليمان","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن دينار","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}]],"variant":true},{"levels":[[{"surface":"ورقاء","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن دينار","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}],[{"surface":"سعيد بن يسار","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبي هريرة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}]],"variant":true},{"levels":[[{"surface":"مسلم بن أبي مريم","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"زيد بن أسلم","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"سهيل","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبي صالح","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}],[{"surface":"أبي هريرة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":3}]],"variant":true}],"shared_tail":null,"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["Main chain: «عبد الرحمن» carries an editor's gloss («هو ابن عبد الله بن دينار»), left out; «أبيه» is a bare relation.","Three variant groups: «تابعه سليمان عن ابن دينار» (a mutabaʿa), «وقال ورقاء عن ابن دينار ...» and «ورواه مسلم بن أبي مريم وزيد بن أسلم وسهيل عن أبي صالح ...»; each names another transmitter for the same saying, so none is a route.","The Prophet is the end of every chain, not a link."],"fixes":[]}